Given the research topic "{{topic}}", generate exactly 3 clarifying questions that would help narrow the scope and improve research quality.

Good questions target:
- Which specific aspect or angle the user cares about most
- The intended audience or depth level (technical vs overview)
- Time period, geography, or domain constraints
- Whether they want comparison, analysis, or factual summary

Output ONLY a JSON array of objects with "question" and "why" fields. Example:
[
  {"question": "Are you interested in recent developments (2024-2026) or historical evolution?", "why": "Narrows the time scope to avoid overly broad search"},
  {"question": "...", "why": "..."},
  {"question": "...", "why": "..."}
]
